      "writtenOn": "2023-04-05T02:04:22Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Is there guidance on whether to check in Cargo.lock files in a Bazel build? The general convention for cargo builds is to _not_ check in Cargo.lock files in library code (see https://doc.rust-lang.org/cargo/guide/cargo-toml-vs-cargo-lock.html and https://doc.rust-lang.org/cargo/faq.html#why-do-binaries-have-cargolock-in-version-control-but-not-libraries)",
      "revId": "b3bb2bb58f9886cee8749ee6da56405381c61d45",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": false,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "f607fd7b_aeccec4d",
